# Overprotect's trample and +3/+3 (CR 702.19b): Bot1's Ornithopter attacks on turn 3 and Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) blocks it.
# After the block, Overprotect makes it a 3/5 trampler: 2 damage is lethal to the blocker and the other 1 reaches Bot2 (20 -> 19).
# Without trample none would. Its own 0 power would have dealt nothing, so the pump is what kills the blocker.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Overprotect
Ornithopter
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Ornithopter
Plains x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Blockers]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Overprotect.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.AssignDamage(Ornithopter > Ornithopter: 2; Ornithopter > Bot2: 1)
[T3 Bot1.Damage]
? Bot2.Life = 19

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 0
